satellite (0.1.0-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Split into two binary packages along the line DESIGN.md section 9 already
    drew through the build: satellite is the interpreter and depends on the C
    and C++ runtimes alone, satellite-term is the GTK 4 window and is the only
    package that pulls gtk4 and vte.
  * Build with prefix=/usr so that -DSATELLITE_LIB_DIR names
    /usr/share/satellite/lib, which makes an installed interpreter find its
    library with no environment variable set.

 -- Terran Satellite <terransatellite@gmail.com>  Fri, 07 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
